// A loop binding nothing reads is an error even with the '_' prefix that
// excuses an ordinary local: the fix is to drop the binding (`repeat 3:`),
// not to rename it.
// EXPECT: E059
func main:
    repeat 3 with _i:
        println "tick"
    end
end
